    "text": {
     "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
     "text": "<h3>Your one-stop supplier for cutting edge FPGA solutions</h3>\r\n<p>Based in Paris, France, REFLEX CES is a well-known and trusted supplier to major OEMs across the world, since 2000.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>REFLEX CES’ team of highly skilled engineers has been focused on designing and manufacturing high-speed boards and rugged system solutions based on high-density industrial FPGAs and processors. Thanks to its expertise in Hardware, Firmware, Software, Mechanics, CAD, and Signal integrity, REFLEX CES offers a wide range of solutions with its products:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Modules</li>\r\n<li>PCIe Boards</li>\r\n<li>Servers &amp; Systems</li>\r\n<li>Full turnkey solutions</li>\r\n<li>Manufacturing</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n",
     "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/text",
     "textIsRich": "true"
    }
   },
