    },
    "text_intro": {
     "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
     "text": "<p>REFLEX CES took their wide FPGA experience, combined it with their embedded knowledge, and created perfectly suitable Modules for your needs. Those System-on-Modules can be used into many embedded applications.</p>",
